se prose-lg article-content"><p>You write <code>echo "a dvd bouncing tui" &=
gt; idea.md</code>, point a runner at <code>dotpowers.dot</code>, and come =
back to a tested, reviewed project in a git branch. One DOT file, ~1300 lin=
es. It encodes the <a href=3D"https://github.com/obra/superpowers">superpow=
ers</a> dev methodology as a pipeline graph =E2=80=94 brainstorming, planni=
ng, TDD implementation, multi-model review, and shipping decisions, all wir=
ed together with failure handling and human gates.</p><h2 id=3D"install">In=
stall</h2><div class=3D"highlight"><pre tabindex=3D"0" style=3D"color: rgb(=
